•	Timer and deadline remain legible on small screens and are not hidden behind menus.
•	Teacher can preview exactly what the learner will see before publishing.
•	Role-specific data and actions are not merely hidden in the frontend; backend permission tests confirm enforcement.
•	Every P0 screen has loading, empty, error, offline and permission-denied states where relevant.
•	Core flows pass keyboard-only and screen-reader spot checks and meet contrast requirements.
