11.1 Collaboration cadence
•	Weekly product/design/engineering planning: goals, decisions, risks, dependencies and scope changes.
•	Twice-weekly short engineering sync during critical integration phases; async status is preferred over status meetings.
•	Weekly demo in staging with working software, not slideware.
